**Step 1: Query Food Database for Scarborough and Etobicoke Locations**

<tool_call>
{"name": "notion_query_database", "arguments": {"database_id": "food_database_001", "filter": {"or": [{"property": "Location", "select": {"equals": "Scarborough"}}, {"property": "Location", "select": {"equals": "Etobicoke"}}]}}}
</tool_call>
<tool_response>
{
  "results": [
